  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "AW2-CI-003" ;
  triage:title "Just lint boundaries fails at fee01b959: sqlite store types made pub in storage_types.rs violate the private implementation.type rule" ;
  triage:description "PR #1179 at fee01b959 (AW2 round 8), Just lint ubuntu and windows: the boundaries lint reports 5 violations because the round-8 test-coverage commit moved SqliteMessageStore, SqliteRosterStore and SqliteNudgeTemplateOverrideStore into a new crates/atm-storage-rusqlite/src/storage_types.rs, which breaks BOUNDARY-AsyncMessageStore-Sqlite, BOUNDARY-MailStore-Sqlite, BOUNDARY-RosterStore-Sqlite and BOUNDARY-NudgeTemplateOverrideStore-Sqlite (implementation.type must stay private to the crate root). arch-ctm had already corrected this on feature/aw3-health-and-log-query in bb1feeaa7 (retain boundary implementation owners: types back in lib.rs, helpers in test_support.rs). fenix cherry-picked bb1feeaa7 onto feature/aw2-sqlite-diagnostic-timeline as 82d194c6d; boundaries, function-length, line counts and atm-storage-rusqlite tests pass locally. Hot-path crate touched: bench-smoke gate must be re-run on the final tip." ;
